**Amazon’s FY2017 DPO was 93.86 days.**

Using the balance sheet and P&L line items (in millions):

\[
\text{DPO}
=365\times\frac{(25{,}309+34{,}616)/2}{111{,}934+(16{,}047-11{,}461)}
=365\times\frac{29{,}962.5}{116{,}520}
=\mathbf{93.86\ days}
\]

Accounts payable and inventories are from the balance sheet (p. 40); FY2017 cost of sales is from the P&L statement (p. 38).

